isplay. Combines COB's superior contrast and reliability with bend capability for concave, convex, and cylindrical installations. A breakthrough for immersive environments.\", \"sku\": \"BL-FLX150\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx150\", \"category\": \"flexible\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-flx150.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1200, \"highPrice\": 8000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx150\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"320 x 160 per module\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}14:Tb2b,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes FlexCOB 1.5mm a unique LED display solution?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"FlexCOB 1.5mm is the industry's first flexible COB LED display, combining superior contrast and brightness with the ability to bend for concave, convex, and cylindrical shapes. This technology enables unique immersive visual experiences not possible with traditional rigid LED panels.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the minimum bend radius for this flexible display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The minimum bend radius of the FlexCOB 1.5mm is 500mm, allowing for smooth curvature in various architectural installations such as curved walls and columns without affecting display performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the brightness of 800 nits impact visibility?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness rating of 800 nits, FlexCOB 1.5mm ensures clear and vibrant images even in moderately lit indoor environments, making it ideal for immersive rooms and display scenarios requiring high visibility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the FlexCOB 1.5mm be serviced easily after installation?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display features rear magnetic service access, allowing for quick and hassle-free maintenance without the need to disassemble the entire installation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this display compare to traditional rigid LED panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional rigid LED panels, FlexCOB 1.5mm uses flexible COB technology providing higher contrast ratios (10,000:1), enhanced durability, and the ability to conform to complex shapes, delivering more immersive and versatile design options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments is this product best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"FlexCOB 1.5mm is ideal for immersive rooms, curved walls, and cylindrical columns where flexible, high-contrast, and bright displays are needed for a captivating visual impact.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty support is available for the FlexCOB 1.5mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty support to ensure reliability and customer satisfaction. Specific warranty terms can be provided upon inquiry depending on project requirements and scale.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is pricing available for bulk or custom installations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing varies based on project size, installation complexity, and customization requirements. Contact Brightluxx directly for tailored quotations and expert consultation.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"],\"$L18\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"FlexCOB 1.5mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx150\\\"}]}\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n17:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n19:T62b,<h1>FlexCOB 1.5mm</h1><p>Get FlexCOB 1.5mm flexible LED displays for curved and dynamic installations. Order in Dubai, UAE with Brightluxx premium solutions.</p><p><strong>Industry first: Flexible COB.</strong></p><p>World's first flexible COB LED display. Combines COB's superior contrast and reliability with bend capability for concave, convex, and cylindrical installations. A breakthrough for immersive environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes FlexCOB 1.5mm a unique LED display solution?</h3><p>FlexCOB 1.5mm is the industry's first flexible COB LED display, combining superior contrast and brightness with the ability to bend for concave, convex, and cylindrical shapes. This technology enables unique immersive visual experiences not possible with traditional rigid LED panels.</p><h3>What is the minimum bend radius for this flexible display?</h3><p>The minimum bend radius of the FlexCOB 1.5mm is 500mm, allowing for smooth curvature in various architectural installations such as curved walls and columns without affecting display performance.</p><h3>How does the brightness of 800 nits impact visibility?</h3><p>With a brightness rating of 800 nits, FlexCOB 1.5mm ensures clear and vibrant images even in moderately lit indoor environments, making it ideal for immersive rooms and display scenarios requiring high visibility.</p><h3>Can the FlexCOB 1.5mm be serviced easily after installation?</h3><p>Yes, the display features rear magnetic service access, allowing for quick and hassle-free maintenance without the need to disassemble the entire installation.</p>18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"FlexCOB 1.5mm LED Display - Flexible LED Screens Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get FlexCOB 1.5mm flexible LED displays for curved and dynamic installations. Order in Dubai, UAE with Brightluxx premium solutions.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx150\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks